hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"143","Humein Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein se jis kisi ke teen bachche faut ho jayen to aag use nahi chhuegi magar qasam ko poora karne ki had tak."
"144","Humein Umar bin Hafs bin Ghiyas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein hamare walid ne bayan kiya, Talq bin Muawiya se, Abu Zura se, Abu Huraira se, ke ek aurat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas ek chhote bachche ke sath aayi to us ne kaha: is ke liye dua kijiye, kyunke main teen bachche dafan kar chuki hoon, to Aap ne farmaya: tune aag se bachne ke liye mazboot baad bandh li hai."
"145","Humein Ayyash ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Ala ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Saeed al-Jurairi ne bayan kiya, Khalid al-Absi se, unhon ne kaha: mera ek beta faut ho gaya to mujhe us par shadeed sadma hua to main ne kaha: Ae Abu Huraira, kya tum ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se koi aisi cheez suni hai jis se tum hamare faut shudgon ke bare mein hamare dilon ko tasalli do, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: tumhare chhote bachche Jannat ke daamees hain."
"146","Humein Ayyash ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Ala ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin al-Harith ne bayan kiya, Mahmud bin Labid se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jis ke teen bachche faut ho jayen aur woh sawab ki niyyat se sabr kare woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga, hum ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, aur do, Aap ne farmaya: aur do, main ne Jabir se kaha: Allah ki qasam, mera khayal hai ke agar tum ek kehte to Aap kehte, unhon ne kaha: aur Allah ki qasam main bhi yehi samajhta hoon."
"147","Humein Ali bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Hafs bin Ghiyas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Talq bin Muawiya se suna, jo un ke dada hain, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Zura se suna, Abu Huraira se, ke ek aurat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas ek chhote bachche ke sath aayi to us ne kaha: Allah se is ke liye dua kijiye, kyunke main teen bachche dafan kar chuki hoon, to Aap ne farmaya: tune aag se bachne ke liye mazboot baad bandh li hai."
"148","Humein Ali ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Suhail bin Abi Salih ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Huraira se: ek aurat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aayi to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, hum aap ki majlis mein aap tak rasayi hasil nahi kar sakteen, to hamare liye koi din muqarrar kar dijiye jis mein hum aap ke paas aayen, to Aap ne farmaya: tumhara wada falan ke ghar par hoga, phir Aap un ke paas is wade ke liye tashreef laye, aur jo baaten Aap ne un se bayan farmaeen un mein ye thi: tum mein se jo aurat ho jis ke teen bachche faut ho jayen aur woh sawab ki niyyat se sabr kare to woh Jannat mein dakhil hogi, to ek aurat ne kaha: ya do, Aap ne farmaya: ya do, Suhail hadees bayan karne mein sakhti karta tha aur yaad rakhta tha, aur koi shakhs us ke paas likhne ki taqat nahi rakhta tha."
"149","Humein Harami bin Hafs aur Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: humein Abdul Wahid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Usman bin Hakim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amr bin Amir al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Umm Sulaim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas thi to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Umm Sulaim, jo bhi do Musalman hon jin ke teen bachche faut ho jayen to Allah un dono ko apni rehmat ke fazl se jo un par hai Jannat mein dakhil farmayega, main ne kaha: aur do, Aap ne farmaya: aur do."
"150","Humein Ali ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Mutamir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Fuzail par qirat ki: Abu Hariz se, ke Hasan ne un se Wasit mein bayan kiya, ke Sasa bin Muawiya ne un se bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Abu Zarr se mulaqat ki jabke woh ek mashkiza kandhe par lagaye hue the, unhon ne kaha: Ae Abu Zarr, tumhari aulad ka kya haal hai, unhon ne kaha: kya main tumhe hadees na sunaoon, main ne kaha: kyun nahi, unhon ne kaha: main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna, Aap farmate the: jo bhi Musalman ho jis ke teen bachche faut ho jayen jo baloghat ki umr ko na pahunche hon to Allah use apni rehmat ke fazl se jo un par hai Jannat mein dakhil farmayega, aur jo shakhs kisi Musalman ko azad kare to Allah azza wa jalla us ke har uzw ko us ke har uzw ke badle aag se chhutkara banayega."
"151","Humein Abdullah bin Abil Aswad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Zakariya bin Umara al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib ne bayan kiya, Anas bin Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: jis ke teen bachche faut ho jayen jo baloghat ki umr ko na pahunche hon to Allah use aur unhe apni rehmat ke fazl se Jannat mein dakhil farmayega."
"152","Humein Ishaq bin Yazid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sadaqa bin Khalid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yazid bin Abi Maryam ne bayan kiya, apni walida se, Sahl bin al-Hanzaliya se, aur un ke haan aulad nahi hoti thi, to unhon ne kaha: mere haan Islam mein ek gira hua bachcha paida ho aur main us par sawab ki ummeed rakhun, ye mujhe is se zyada mehboob hai ke mujhe saari duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai mil jaye, aur Ibn al-Hanzaliya un logon mein se the jinhon ne darakht ke neeche baiat ki thi."
"153","Humein Muhammad bin Salam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abu Muawiya ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: humein Amash ne bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Taimi se, Harith bin Suwaid se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum mein se kaun hai jis ko apne waris ka maal apne maal se zyada mehboob ho, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, hum mein se koi bhi nahi magar us ka apna maal use apne waris ke maal se zyada mehboob hai, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jaan lo ke tum mein se koi nahi magar us ke waris ka maal use apne maal se zyada mehboob hai, tumhara maal woh hai jo tum ne aage bheja, aur tumhare waris ka maal woh hai jo tum ne peeche chhoda."
"154","Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum apne darmiyan raqoob kise shumar karte ho, unhon ne kaha: raqoob woh hai jis ke haan bachcha paida na ho, Aap ne farmaya: nahi, lekin raqoob woh hai jis ne apni aulad mein se kuch aage na bheja ho."
"155","Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum apne darmiyan pehlwan kise shumar karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Wo hai jise mard pachar na saken, pas Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, lekin pehlwan wo hai jo gusse ke waqt apne nafs ko qaboo me rakhta hai."
